    "name": "Moor Rail",
    "steam_appid": 3009410,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/3371815ca793b8a7f4ff26a2bc4d2325.avif?t=1748840792\" data-has-big width=800 height=282 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300aMoor Rail\u300b is a strategic lateral scroll shooting action game set in diesel funk.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you strengthen your train, you can increase your load, speed up, and install vehicles that assist or attack your battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hire several mercenaries who fight together on the train and help combat situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Marigold of a delivery driver from a carrier who receives a commission and carries the goods will receive a suspicious commission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a simple request to purchase a &quot;Core&quot; item from a far away village and transport it to the destination, but, unsuspectingly, the compensation for the request was a large amount of compensation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I was suspicious, but Marigold started delivering because it was a request.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will we be able to deliver it safely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<strong>\u25c6 Reach your destination by stopping enemies from attacking on a running train.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/ac716221ee3968f04d2a4dc572ef8927.poster.avif?t=1748840792\" width=742 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/ac716221ee3968f04d2a4dc572ef8927.webm?t=1748840792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/ac716221ee3968f04d2a4dc572ef8927.mp4?t=1748840792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can stop enemies by using specialized skills and weapons that vary from character to character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your skills and items to help you win by applying them to your player's advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Beware of mutated bosses or looters who are powerful and do not die easily.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/5f40c1aff2fddfbd6a64c6ee50454559.poster.avif?t=1748840792\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/5f40c1aff2fddfbd6a64c6ee50454559.webm?t=1748840792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/5f40c1aff2fddfbd6a64c6ee50454559.mp4?t=1748840792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of boss will appear? What pattern will the boss use?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a boss match, you have to figure out the pattern and play it to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How big a treatment reward would I get if I killed my boss?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Make maintenance at the station to reach your destination.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/4d19e7da0094070bf4c82d117b741c5f.avif?t=1748840792\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can deploy trains according to their roles, so you can use a variety of strategies, and the upgrade will allow you to run better-performing trains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, you can upgrade the passive and player that are applied to your advantage in the game to facilitate play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 To move on to the next chapter, succeed in the quest.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/fce0c2df2d40203f59f9d88b9aaa1324.avif?t=1748840792\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select and proceed with the quest that the player wants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you give up or fail the quest, you will be fined a hefty fine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail and pay the fine, succeed and earn the reward!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/3371815ca793b8a7f4ff26a2bc4d2325.avif?t=1748840792\" data-has-big width=800 height=282 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300aMoor Rail\u300b is a strategic lateral scroll shooting action game set in diesel funk.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you strengthen your train, you can increase your load, speed up, and install vehicles that assist or attack your battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hire several mercenaries who fight together on the train and help combat situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Marigold of a delivery driver from a carrier who receives a commission and carries the goods will receive a suspicious commission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a simple request to purchase a &quot;Core&quot; item from a far away village and transport it to the destination, but, unsuspectingly, the compensation for the request was a large amount of compensation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I was suspicious, but Marigold started delivering because it was a request.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will we be able to deliver it safely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<strong>\u25c6 Reach your destination by stopping enemies from attacking on a running train.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/ac716221ee3968f04d2a4dc572ef8927.poster.avif?t=1748840792\" width=742 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/ac716221ee3968f04d2a4dc572ef8927.webm?t=1748840792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/ac716221ee3968f04d2a4dc572ef8927.mp4?t=1748840792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can stop enemies by using specialized skills and weapons that vary from character to character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your skills and items to help you win by applying them to your player's advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Beware of mutated bosses or looters who are powerful and do not die easily.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/5f40c1aff2fddfbd6a64c6ee50454559.poster.avif?t=1748840792\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/5f40c1aff2fddfbd6a64c6ee50454559.webm?t=1748840792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/5f40c1aff2fddfbd6a64c6ee50454559.mp4?t=1748840792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of boss will appear? What pattern will the boss use?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a boss match, you have to figure out the pattern and play it to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How big a treatment reward would I get if I killed my boss?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Make maintenance at the station to reach your destination.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/4d19e7da0094070bf4c82d117b741c5f.avif?t=1748840792\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can deploy trains according to their roles, so you can use a variety of strategies, and the upgrade will allow you to run better-performing trains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, you can upgrade the passive and player that are applied to your advantage in the game to facilitate play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 To move on to the next chapter, succeed in the quest.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009410/extras/fce0c2df2d40203f59f9d88b9aaa1324.avif?t=1748840792\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select and proceed with the quest that the player wants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you give up or fail the quest, you will be fined a hefty fine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail and pay the fine, succeed and earn the reward!</p>",
